lass 1 finish the race, let alone win it?","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/mlsoR4Q7UciSDPfnXvSBXgYS0CI.jpg"},{"title":"Everyone but Us Went Home for the Holidays.","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"14461","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"107372","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"58173","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"99088","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"412566","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"86517","synopsis":"The semester is ending, and Ms. Suzuki is still missing in action. When most of their classmates go home for the holidays, Kurumi and Yuzu open up about what magic means to each of them.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rYZBfyhu8VkqTru2Bl9mCEIu296.jpg"},{"title":"Happy Holidays, Except I'm Feeling Sad!","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"14461","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"107372","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"58173","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"99088","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"412566","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"86620","synopsis":"Yuzu's success with ancient magic deals Kurumi's confidence another blow. While her friends celebrate the new year, she struggles to choose her path forward. Then a sudden distress call from the MaRC brings everything to a head.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/pg7HDAAi8fhTgqB5Uovpzyyexen.jpg"},{"title":"I'll Be Having the Complete Sauna Experience!","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"14461","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"107372","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provi