 placement test—their last shot at joining the Magumi.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/55CgBPifwUnBAnEFmf0EAaxkIOp.jpg"},{"title":"I'm Gonna Cast Ancient Magic!","episodeNumber":11,"sourceEpisodeNumber":11,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"14461","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"107372","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"mal","id":"58173","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"99088","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"412566","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[11]}],"link":"87025","synopsis":"Kurumi and friends have found their Ms. Suzuki, but they still don't know what's hurting their classmates. When a confrontation between teachers reveals the secret slumbering beneath Rettoran, the girls may be the school's only hope.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dxOejfOyydPPIcuy92wFlBDXVQP.jpg"},{"title":"I Want to Be More Than a Magician.","episodeNumber":12,"sourceEpisodeNumber":12,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"14461","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"107372","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"mal","id":"58173","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"99088","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"412566","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[12]}],"link":"87169","synopsis":"Together, Kurumi and Yuzu avert the disaster looming over Rettoran and save their friends. But what does the future hold for them? When Yuzu goes to retake the Magumi placement test, she finds Kurumi nowhere in sight.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/pjcHUNFDYf3gBQshrl13qjAkyE5.jpg"}],"sourceIds":{"anilistId":107372,"malId":58173},"mappings":{"source":"anibridge-v3","schemaVersion":"3.0.3","generatedOn":"2026-10-28T07:48:11Z","sourceDescriptors":["anilist:107372","mal:58173"],"imdbSource":"plexanibridge-